Error [jet.BindingGenerationFailed]: Could not generate bindings from `{work}/broken.pas`.
 Why: `fpc` rejected the Pascal binding source: compilation failed.
 Fix: Export `Int64`/`Double` cdecl routines plus `<class>_new`, `<class>_free`, and pointer-first scalar method wrappers, then rerun `jet inspect bind pascal`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3208
